    "body": "> I also wonder why the vertical centering is implemented in prose instead of in CSS. There must be a history there... @mattto?\r\n\r\n@tabatkins might know the history more. Do you mean why vertical centering was specified for dialog itself rather than as a CSS feature? It could be that it depended so much on centering as part of the showModal() call which included placing the dialog in the top layer.",
